  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A contribution to Raoul Wallenberg Institute&apos;s HR programme in Indonesia 2007-2009, focusing on training and capacity-building for the country&apos;s correctional services, support for the National HR action plan, surveying reproductive health in East Java, to promote HR-based poverty alleviation parallell reporting.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett bidrag till Raoul Wallenberg institutets MR-program i Indonesien 2007-2009, med fokus p&#xe5; utbildning och kapacitetsst&#xf6;d till landets kriminalv&#xe5;rd, st&#xf6;d till den nationella MR-handlingsplanen, g&#xf6;ra en studie p&#xe5; reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa i &#xf6;stra Java, att fr&#xe4;mja parallell rapportering om MR-baserad fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning.</narrative>
  </description>
